flowchart TB
    C[Clients and Merchants] --> API[Payments API]
    API --> OR[Payment Orchestrator]

    OR --> ID[(Idempotency Records)]
    OR --> PS[(Payment Intent and Transaction Store)]
    OR --> ES[(Ledger and Event Store)]
    OR --> OB[(Outbox Queue)]

    OB --> GA[Gateway Adapters]
    GA --> PG[Payment Gateways]
    PG --> WH[Webhook Handler]

    WH --> PD[(Provider Event Dedupe)]
    WH --> OR

    RJ[Reconciliation Jobs] --> PG
    RJ --> RR[(Reconciliation Records)]
    RJ --> ES
    ES --> OD[Ops Dashboard]
